oss":"Grand, splendid; auspicious."},{"iast":"caraṇa","name":"Charan","devanagari":"चरण","dictionary_gloss":"Foot; refuge."},{"iast":"cetana","name":"Chetan","devanagari":"चेतन","dictionary_gloss":"Conscious, sentient, alive."},{"iast":"darśana","name":"Darshan","devanagari":"दर्शन","dictionary_gloss":"Sight, vision; a philosophical school."},{"iast":"dhairya","name":"Dhairya","devanagari":"धैर्य","dictionary_gloss":"Courage, patience, steadiness."},{"iast":"digvijaya","name":"Digvijay","devanagari":"दिग्विजय","dictionary_gloss":"Conqueror of all directions."},{"iast":"ekāṃśa","name":"Ekansh","devanagari":"एकांश","dictionary_gloss":"One part; whole, unified."},{"iast":"jīvana","name":"Jeevan","devanagari":"जीवन","dictionary_gloss":"Life."},{"iast":"kauśika","name":"Kaushik","devanagari":"कौशिक","dictionary_gloss":"Descendant of Kushika; Vishwamitra's family."},{"iast":"kiraṇa","name":"Kiran","devanagari":"किरण","dictionary_gloss":"Ray of light."},{"iast":"kṣitija","name":"Kshitij","devanagari":"क्षितिज","dictionary_gloss":"Horizon; born of the earth."},{"iast":"lakṣya","name":"Lakshay","devanagari":"लक्ष्य","dictionary_gloss":"Aim, target, goal."},{"iast":"mahāvīra","name":"Mahavir","devanagari":"महावीर","dictionary_gloss":"Great hero; the 24th Jain Tirthankara."},{"iast":"manohara","name":"Manohar","devanagari":"मनोहर","dictionary_gloss":"Heart-stealing, charming."},{"iast":"nirmala","name":"Nirmal","devanagari":"निर्मल","dictionary_gloss":"Pure, spotless."},{"iast":"pīyūṣa","name":"Piyush","devanagari":"पीयूष","dictionary_gloss":"Nectar."},{"iast":"pratīka","name":"Pratik","devanagari":"प्रतीक","dictionary_gloss":"Symbol, emblem."},{"iast":"puruṣottama","name":"Purushottam","devanagari":"पुरुषोत्तम","dictionary_gloss":"Best of men; Vishnu or Rama."},{"iast":"ramaṇa","name":"Raman","devanagari":"रमण","dictionary_gloss":"Pleasing, delightful."},{"iast":"sacīna","name":"Sachin","devanagari":"सचिन","dictionary_gloss":"Modern name; popularly glossed \"pure\", etymology